      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wilhoit%2C_Arizona"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Frank Wilhoit also built culverts for the road connecting Phoenix and Prescott, helping shape the area’s early infrastructure.",
